  "description": "What if this incredibly hot guy becomes my boyfriend...? \n\nNow that he's a college student, Taein's interest is solely focused on getting a pretty girlfriend. In reality, he not only gets a confession of love from a dude, Green, but he just can't get rid of him! After searching for ways to get rid of him, Taein and his friends find one solution, which is to date the most popular guy in his university: Soohyuk Yoo. Taein finally approaches Soohyuk without realizing the two of them are getting closer than he had expected... \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
